WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Example ideas only. Design your own sample return mission.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Include at least 5 obstacles. How will you protect your sample route?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.600
One obstacle example: how could you reach your capsule safely?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.800
Cache two samples and signal. At your capsule, code launch().

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.000
The capsule returns samples; the rover stays on Mars. Explain your design.
